<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 24, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 24, background: '#7C3AED', borderRadius: 4 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>AI 产品经理实战训练营 · W2D3</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 24, right: 60, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>05 / 18</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>Benchmark 概览与三个局限</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ marginTop: 24, fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B' }}>公开基准测试能快速横向比较模型，但拿它当产品验收依据，会踩三个坑。</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 24, height: 360 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 28, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, borderRadius: 6, background: '#7C3AED', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>考的不是你的场景</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>反例：通用基准分再高，也不代表它答得好你们产品的客服话术和业务规则。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 28, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>可能被刷榜污染</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>反例：题目公开流传后，模型可能见过原题，榜单分数已经不能代表真实能力。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 28, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, borderRadius: 6, background: '#7C3AED', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>测不了产品体验</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>反例：答题正确不等于好用——格式乱、语气僵、响应慢，这些体验问题榜上看不到。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
